senses.gloss:
√nud (nudáti, -te; nunóda, nunudé;
ánutta [881]; notsyáti, -te; nuttá, nunná;
-núdya). push; thrust.
+ parā, thrust away; move from its
place.
+ pra, push forward; set in motion.
+ vi, drive asunder or away; turn away,
esp. from cares, like the Eng. di-vert;
amuse. [for mg, cf. also dis-port and
s-port.]
